### =============================================================
### taller-back — REST Client (VSCode extension "REST Client")
### =============================================================
### No hay prefijo /api/v1 todavía (ver main.ts) — rutas planas.
### Ejecutar primero "Login" o "Login DIRECTOR": las siguientes
### requests reutilizan {{login.response.body.accessToken}} y
### {{login.response.body.refreshToken}} automáticamente.
### =============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ID de usuario a usar en los endpoints /users/:id de más abajo
@userId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_UN_ID_REAL


## =====================================================
## AUTH — /auth
## =====================================================

### Login (ADMIN)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@taller.com",
  "password": "NuevaPassword1234!"
}

### Refresh token — rota el par access/refresh
# @name refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Cambiar contraseña (autenticado) — revoca todas las sesiones del usuario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Admin1234!Secure",
  "newPassword": "NuevaPassword1234!"
}

### Logout — revoca el refresh token (o su familia)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}


## =====================================================
## USERS — /users  (requiere Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>)
## =====================================================

### Perfil del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Crear usuario — requiere permiso "user:manage" (ADMIN)
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevo.tecnico@taller.com",
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "TECHNICIAN",
  "kpiTitle": "Técnico Nivel 2"
}

### Listar usuarios — requiere permiso "user:manage"
### Filtros: page, limit (máx 100), includeInactive, role
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=20&includeInactive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Listar usuarios filtrando por rol
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?role=TECHNICIAN
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Actualizar usuario — requiere permiso "user:manage"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan Actualizado",
  "kpiTitle": "Técnico Senior",
  "role": "TECHNICIAN"
}

### Reemplazar permisos del usuario — requiere permiso "user:manage"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissions": [
    { "permissionId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_DE_PERMISO", "granted": true }
  ]
}

### Desactivar usuario (soft-delete) — requiere permiso "user:manage"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
